# "If you control a Demon": Bot2's Demon, from its own Ritual Chamber on turn 2, is not Bot1's, so at the end of turn 3 Bot1's
# Unholy Annex draws a card and takes the other branch, "otherwise, you lose 2 life" - and Bot2 loses nothing. (At the end of turn 1
# Bot1 had lost 2 as well, with no Demon anywhere: 20 -> 18 -> 16.) The same ability with Bot1's own Demon is the drain in the
# other Room scenarios.

